WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.760
PINBALL HAZARD

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.360
It's not what I think it is?

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:14.080
Seriously? Underwear?

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:17.840
Framed underwear?
Have you ever seen that?

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:21.240
No, it's definitely a first for me.

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:25.800
Oh!

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:30.880
It's so dark.
It's starting to feel like a trap.

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:34.920
Oh.

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:37.960
I've seen those before.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:45.120
I find this interesting choice
of decoration, rather poetic.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:48.320
Not another click!

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:53.120
Were we not just talking about traps?

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.160
I was actually talking about poetry.

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:02.640
I thought I'd gotten us in a pickle.
That sound...

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:07.720
I swear I didn't do it!

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.800
All right. I think the coast is clear.

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:19.440
It was just to turn on the lights.

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:24.640
Whenever you say something,
the opposite happens?

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:27.080
I know.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:52.720
This isn't going to be good!
This isn't good at all!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.400
You good, Ruel?

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:17.720
You know me. I'm not the type
to complain for no reason...

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:23.320
but right now I won't lie to you,
I'm not feeling great. I feel awful.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:28.760
I just heard my body cracking in places
where it usually doesn't.

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:29.960
Hey, guys.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.840
Yet another weirdo.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.280
A collector!

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.800
A collector, little girl, not a loony.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.440
Too young to understand.

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:57.880
I am Black Bump, the Feca demigod,
and this place is my humble home.

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:00.400
He looks pretty strong.

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:05.520
I assume you know who we are
and your orders are to slow us down?

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.440
Slow you down?

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:15.600
I've heard a lot about you,
but nothing about being funny.

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:20.880
No one leaves without my consent.
I could do far more than that!

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:25.800
No point wasting time,
we already know how this will end.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:29.040
Calm down. I'm not like the others.

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:33.760
I follow no one
and I am willing to let you pass.

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:35.800
Really?

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:39.840
Yes, just as long as you all pay the toll.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:44.040
Pay the toll!

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:49.360
We're not paying for anything!
The little one's right.

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:51.160
The tightwad is awake.

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:54.680
You take care of him while I recover.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:57.720
The living proof of masculine bravery!

00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:02.040
We'll see if you're still so hot-blooded
at my age.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:06.040
We don't have any valuable items.

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:10.560
You have your underwear!

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:14.800
Anything but that...

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:22.000
Everybody has a pair of underwear
and that's just what I want!

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:27.440
What do you think?

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:33.040
It's our chance to escape.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.480
We don't know what's there
and with my big belly--

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.280
I'll protect you, Ma.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:45.440
He cannot be serious!

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:50.760
Is the crossing fee too pricey for you?
Many consider it cheap.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.200
Not pricey, absurd!

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:55.840
Maybe to you, but not to me.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:57.400
No way.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:02.360
Not yours, child.
Do you think I'm some kind of pervert?

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:04.920
I want theirs.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:09.360
Mr. Stroud's underpants
will be displayed here,

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:11.800
in the pantheon of the greatest riches.

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:14.120
He will be ranked seventh.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:16.080
Seventh? That's it?

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:22.600
Yes. Our young friend, Yugo,
will be placed among the rare Eliatropes.

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:25.880
And the cherry on the cake,

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:30.480
I'll be able to add a new princess
to my collection.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.960
He is a total animal.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:47.960
As for you, you don't deserve to be
in my very exclusive collection yet.

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:52.120
Mr. Bump, I really don't care
about any of that.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:56.080
-Just give him it and we can get going.
-What?

00:06:56.160 --> 00:07:01.000
She's got a point. I've been meaning
to change my underwear for 25 years.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:03.920
I don't mind going commando,
so I won't miss them.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:06.920
For once, I'm okay with paying up.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:11.280
Are you delirious? If you seriously think
that I'm going to give him--

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:14.720
You're mistaken.
We won't give you anything.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:18.200
If you want it, come and get it!

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:21.280
It would be my honor.

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:25.840
The rules are simple. See these two poles?

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:31.000
Combined, they form the key
that will get you out of here.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.640
This shouldn't be hard.

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:48.880
Yugo!

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:55.600
Yugo, are you okay?

00:07:56.960 --> 00:08:01.280
I'm fine. It's just going to be
a bit harder than I thought.

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:05.560
I'd rather die than give him anything.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:11.120
What a tragedy.

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:14.960
You should be honored
that I'm asking you.

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:20.840
My collection contains boxers and panties
from &lt;i&gt;the crème de la crème &lt;/i&gt;of Krosmoz.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:25.400
Intimacy is the path to the soul.
What's more intimate than underwear?

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:30.120
Having all these fragments of souls
fills me with joy,

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:33.000
because I know I'm the guardian...

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:35.680
of a magnificent temple.

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:40.560
And I will not tolerate blasphemy.

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:43.000
A force field surrounds him.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:46.600
He doesn't need any armor.
This won't be easy.

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:49.320
Papa likes opponents like him

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:53.920
who don't show their weak points
until you find them.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.920
What would Papa do?

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:03.400
-I know!
-Elely!

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:07.560
He would have gone
straight into the fight.

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:10.320
Foolish little girl!

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:18.960
He would have taken a few hits
to test the waters!

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:23.240
Are you going to fight like a man,
or hide behind your shield?

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:27.240
You are pathetic!

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:40.240
You guys see that?
This dummy isn't untouchable.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:46.600
Hey, little know-it-all,
I've told you, I'm not interested in you!

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:50.360
Elely!

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:06.320
I'm not really sure if copying your dad's
fighting style is the wisest choice.

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:09.200
You should just... find your own.

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:13.040
It's the family style.
It always pays off in the end!

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:15.560
Move aside. I'm going to make a portal.

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:23.240
It seems you haven't figured it out yet.

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:27.240
Nothing in the world can get
through my force Bumpers.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:30.960
It doesn't matter, Yugo.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:34.200
I found his weak point, when he attacks...

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:36.920
He needs to turn off his force field.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.360
I noticed too, thanks to you, Elely.

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:43.200
Sadlygrove style! Take a few hits
to find out where it hurts!

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.600
Dally would be proud.

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:48.680
Don't encourage her like that, Yugo.

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:52.720
Amalia, Ruel, let's show this clown
what we're made of!

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:55.600
We'll make him shake
in his tighty-whities.

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:57.800
He's going to soil his pants!

00:10:58.360 --> 00:10:59.840
You stupid fools!

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:14.080
So you've been wearing
the same underwear for 25 years?

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:16.320
I inherited them from my grandpa!

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.720
Oh, that's wonderful.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.160
-No!
-Ruel!

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:43.840
Now the next!

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:07.040
You bunch of chumps! I don't know
what you thought you saw before,

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.760
but my force fields have no weaknesses!

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:14.240
This room is designed so that I can defeat
anyone who enters,

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:16.280
without using any weapon.

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.280
Amalia...

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:26.840
As for you, your panties will be placed
in the "stuck-up princess" category.

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:34.720
Don't touch her!

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:40.920
-You okay, Amalia?
-Yeah I'm fine.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:49.920
Well done, you've exhausted
what little patience I had.

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:54.480
You're about to see what kind of surprises
this room hides.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:57.440
Prepare yourselves!

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:08.800
A rolling sound.
It's... coming from the walls.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:22.680
Merrily they roll along...

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:52.200
Doesn't the void ever call out to you?

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:55.680
Not the void you're talking about.

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:57.640
Echo?

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:06.000
How do you always spot me so easily?
I want to know your secret!

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:10.840
He says "Echo" every five minutes
and sometimes you're actually there,

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:14.160
so it gives the illusion
he can see everything.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:17.080
If Adamai gives all my tricks away,
I'm done for.

00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:22.720
Our guests are with Bump.
They're advancing quickly.

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:27.080
Evangelyne and Flopin are waiting
in the Eniripsa temple.

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:31.280
Perfect. Soon it will be time for Flopin
to reveal his potential to us.

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:14.000
We can't win. It's never-ending.

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:18.760
You can't give up hope yet!
I've figured out a solution.

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:22.080
I just saw one ball rebound
and crash into the floor.

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:24.520
It's the only part without a force field.

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:28.520
If you can get them to bounce downwards,
you might get rid of them.

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:31.240
That sounds like a plan.

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:44.880
They keep bouncing back and forth.
We need to get them rolling faster.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.520
I could try to make ramps.

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:50.440
The more speed they pick up,
the more of a risk they'll be to us.

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:52.720
We'll get through this. We always do.

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:57.240
Let's do this, then. Make them go faster
when they're rolling towards him.

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.240
Wretched fools...

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.720
Now, Amalia!

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.560
So you want some more?

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:20.520
Behind me!

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:25.800
My temple...

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:31.760
No!

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:10.840
What a commotion!

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:27.720
Amalia, you risked your life for me.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:33.000
If you hadn't, I'd be...

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:37.440
You've done the same for me
so many times.

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:55.120
One thing's for sure.

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:58.480
You're not as dumb as I thought.

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:02.960
And you two are just so cute.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:06.680
You should have stayed in your hole!

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:09.920
All alone, little Eliatrope.

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.640
We'll see who's little!

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:28.320
I hope you're not flat out.

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:35.920
What did you expect, kid? I'm a Feca!

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.520
My armor was only amplifying
my force fields.

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:41.760
Stop calling me that! I'm not a kid!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:49.960
You again.

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:55.000
We aren't finished yet.

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:32.000
I... just wanted...

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:35.680
...to have your underpants.

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:45.960
Awesome fight, Yugo!

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:48.720
I didn't know you could fight like that!

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:52.640
Yeah, me neither! Thanks, Ruel!
I owe you one.

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:56.240
It was my pleasure, buddy.

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:02.440
Let's see what's next.

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:12.560
Yugo... That was amazing.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:18.200
Don't you think it's time for us
to admit how we feel about each other?

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:22.440
You know that it's impossible, Amalia.

00:20:25.400 --> 00:20:27.040
Nothing's impossible.

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:40.440
No, don't! It will never work between us.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:52.000
I might or might not grow up,
but I don't want you to wait for me.

00:20:53.240 --> 00:20:55.800
I've barely changed after all these years.

00:20:56.840 --> 00:20:59.440
Yeah, maybe, but inside,
I know you're a man.

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:02.480
Don't make me doubt. It just won't work.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:05.400
But you're the one who kissed me!

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:08.440
Yeah, I know. It was a mistake.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.640
I could never give you
what you want from me.

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:19.520
It was a mistake?
You kissed me by mistake?

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:26.880
You selfish jerk! Did you even think
about how I might be feeling?

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:52.760
As if things weren't complicated enough...

